  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1209.02 Reporting and Notification of Violations. The O/O of a PORS at which a bacteria violation has occurred shall comply with Env-Dw 709.24 relative to reporting and notifications, provided that any reference to “PWS” shall be deemed to mean “PORS”.\n\nSource. #9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
